  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:215px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Cancroidus.PNG\" title=\"Cancroidus\"><img alt=\"Cancroidus\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/Cancroidus.PNG\" width=\"213\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Cancroidus.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Cancroidus</div></div></div>\n<p>Cancroidus is a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Toxic Mutant Puker\">Toxic Mutant Puker</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">Doug's Digsite</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a> Level 5.  He has the mutated 'Rice', which is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest_Pot_Luck_II\" title=\"Widower's Nest Pot Luck II\">Widower's Nest Pot Luck II</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
